# Mindwhisker {2}{U}, 3/2: "At the beginning of your upkeep, surveil 1." and "Threshold - As long as there are seven or more cards in your
# graveyard, creatures your opponents control get -1/-0." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (three Moxen pay), Bot2 casts an Elvish Mystic (1/1)
# on turn 2. On turn 3 the upkeep surveil bins an Island (1 card), Brain Freeze on Bot1 mills three Islands and goes to the
# graveyard (5), and a Lightning Bolt makes six: the Mystic is still 1/1 (one short of the limit). On turn 5 the surveil bins a second
# Island: seven, and the Mystic is 0/1 while Mindwhisker itself (its controller's own creature) stays 3/2.

